<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Glow Atelier | Maquiagem</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --rosa: #f26ca7;
      --rosa-escuro: #d94f90;
      --roxo: #7d4ed6;
      --preto: #1d1a1f;
      --cinza: #f5f1f7;
      --branco: #ffffff;
      --texto: #3b2d3a;
      --sombra: 0 15px 35px rgba(126, 74, 145, 0.18);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff7fb 0%, #fff 100%);
      color: var(--texto);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1120px, 90%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(125, 78, 214, 0.08);
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 18px 0;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--preto);
    }

    .logo-mark {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rosa), var(--roxo));
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--branco);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      box-shadow: var(--sombra);
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 28px;
      color: var(--texto);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--rosa-escuro);
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 26px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: 0.3s ease;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rosa), var(--roxo));
      color: var(--branco);
      box-shadow: var(--sombra);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: var(--branco);
      color: var(--preto);
      border: 1px solid rgba(29, 26, 31, 0.08);
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 80px 0 60px;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #ffe4f1;
      color: var(--rosa-escuro);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 5rem);
      line-height: 1.06;
      color: var(--preto);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      color: #5a4657;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .rating {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      color: var(--texto);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .stars {
      color: #ffb700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .hero-visual {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 560px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .card {
      position: absolute;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
      border: 1px solid rgba(125, 78, 214, 0.08);
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--sombra);
      padding: 18px 20px;
    }

    .mini-card {
      top: 40px;
      right: 40px;
      width: 200px;
    }

    .mini-card strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      color: var(--preto);
    }

    .mini-card span {
      color: #6a5870;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .main-product {
      width: min(420px, 88%);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fef3fa 0%, #f8ecff 100%);
      border-radius: 32px;
      box-shadow: var(--sombra);
      padding: 18px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .product-image {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd7ee, #ddc7ff 45%, #f7d3c3);
      border-radius: 24px;
      height: 440px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .product-image::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 220px;
      height: 220px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
      top: 48px;
      left: 95px;
    }

    .product-image::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 180px;
      height: 320px;
      border-radius: 100px 100px 90px 90px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f9d5e7, #7d4ed6);
      bottom: 0;
      left: 120px;
      box-shadow: inset -16px -18px 35px rgba(62, 30, 83, 0.22);
    }

    .social-proof {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 34px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .proof-box {
      background: var(--branco);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 20px 18px;
      min-width: 160px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(41, 24, 52, 0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(61, 40, 74, 0.05);
    }

    .proof-box strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      color: var(--preto);
    }

    .proof-box span {
      color: #625067;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 70px 0;
    }

    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      color: var(--preto);
    }

    .section-header p {
      max-width: 560px;
      color: #5a4657;
    }

    .products-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 26px;
    }

    .product-card {
      background: var(--branco);
      border-radius: 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(125, 78, 214, 0.08);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(26, 14, 35, 0.05);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .product-thumb {
      height: 260px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fce7f7, #e2d4ff, #ffe3d1);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .product-thumb::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.28);
      top: 20px;
      left: 48px;
    }

    .product-thumb::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 110px;
      height: 160px;
      border-radius: 30px 30px 60px 60px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f9d9e4, #ae7ae8);
      bottom: -10px;
      left: calc(50% - 55px);
      box-shadow: inset -10px -12px 20px rgba(60, 33, 78, 0.18);
    }

    .product-info {
      padding: 22px 20px 24px;
    }

    .product-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #f8eaf6;
      color: var(--rosa-escuro);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .price {
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--preto);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .product-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--preto);
    }

    .product-card p {
      color: #5e4d5d;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .about {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff7fb 0%, #f4edff 100%);
      border-radius: 32px;
      padding: 40px 36px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about-visual {
      height: 420px;
      border-radius: 28px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffdfe9, #dbc4ff 50%, #ffe1d2);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .about-visual::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 260px;
      height: 260px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
      top: 50px;
      left: 90px;
    }

    .about-visual::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 170px;
      height: 300px;
      border-radius: 90px 90px 70px 70px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f7d7ea, #9d67f4);
      bottom: 0;
      left: calc(50% - 85px);
      box-shadow: inset -14px -16px 25px rgba(52, 31, 76, 0.2);
    }

    .about-content p {
      color: #5a4657;
      margin: 16px 0 22px;
    }

    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .feature {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      border: 1px solid rgba(125, 78, 214, 0.08);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 18px 16px;
    }

    .feature strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--preto);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .feature span {
      color: #624f66;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .cta {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 90px 0 80px;
    }

    .cta-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d1a1f, #3a2d43);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 52px 30px;
      color: var(--branco);
      box-shadow: var(--sombra);
    }

    .cta-box h2 {
      color: var(--branco);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .cta-box p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    }

    footer {
      padding: 18px 0 38px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #675669;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero-grid,
      .about,
      .products-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 52px;
      }

      .features {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .btn {
        width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .section {
        padding: 58px 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <a href="#" class="logo">
        <span class="logo-mark">G</span>
        <span>Glow Atelier</span>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Menu principal">
        <a href="#produtos">Produtos</a>
        <a href="#sobre">Sobre</a>
        <a href="#colecoes">Coleções</a>
        <a href="#contato">Contato</a>
      </nav>

      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#produtos">Comprar agora</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Beauty Essentials</span>
          <h1>Realce natural para cada momento.</h1>
          <p>
            Descubra produtos de maquiagem premium que unem pigmentação intensa,
            textura leve e acabamento sofisticado para uma pele impecável todos os dias.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#produtos">Confira a coleção</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#sobre">Saiba mais</a>
          </div>

          <div class="rating">
            <div class="stars" aria-label="Avaliação 5 estrelas">★★★★★</div>
            <span>4,9/5 por mais de 12 mil clientes</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Produto de maquiagem destaque">
          <div class="card mini-card">
            <span>Mais vendido</span>
            <strong>+ 32k</strong>
            <span>unidades entregues</span>
          </div>

          <div class="main-product">
            <div class="product-image" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="container social-proof">
        <div class="proof-box">
          <strong>250k+</strong>
          <span>produtos vendidos</span>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-box">
          <strong>120+</strong>
          <span>tonalidades</span>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-box">
          <strong>48h</strong>
          <span>entrega expressa</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="produtos">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Essentials da sua rotina</h2>
          <p>Formulados para brilho, conforto e cobertura impecável em todas as ocasiões.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="products-grid">
          <article class="product-card">
            <div class="product-thumb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="product-info">
              <div class="product-meta">
                <span class="tag">Base</span>
                <span class="price">R$ 89</span>
              </div>
              <h3>Base Velvet Glow</h3>
              <p>Acabamento natural com efeito hidratado e cobertura suave à média.</p>
              <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Adicionar</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="product-card">
            <div class="product-thumb" aria-hidden="true" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #f9e0f6, #e7d0ff, #f6d9c7);"></div>
            <div class="product-info">
              <div class="product-meta">
                <span class="tag">Boca</span>
                <span class="price">R$ 59</span>
              </div>
              <h3>Batom Satin Rose</h3>
              <p>Cor intensa e maciez instantânea para um acabamento luxuoso e confortável.</p>
              <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Adicionar</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="product-card">
            <div class="product-thumb" aria-hidden="true" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #fde3ee, #f1dbff, #ffe0d3);"></div>
            <div class="product-info">
              <div class="product-meta">
                <span class="tag">Olhos</span>
                <span class="price">R$ 72</span>
              </div>
              <h3>Sombra Prism</h3>
              <p>Textura sedosa com brilho sofisticado e alta pigmentação para olhar marcante.</p>
              <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Adicionar</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="sobre">
      <div class="container about">
        <div class="about-visual" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="about-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Nossa história</span>
          <h2>Beleza com cuidado e autenticidade.</h2>
          <p>
            Na Glow Atelier, acreditamos que maquiagem deve realçar sua essência e valorizar
            cada detalhe. Por isso, criamos fórmulas pensadas para pele sensível, uso diário e
            ocasiões especiais com acabamento premium.
          </p>
          <p>
            Cada coleção é desenvolvida com ingredientes selecionados, cores inspiradas na moda e
            uma experiência de uso que mistura tecnologia, conforto e elegância.
          </p>

          <div class="features">
            <div class="feature">
              <strong>100%</strong>
              <span>sem crueldade</span>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
              <strong>Vegan</strong>
              <span>fórmulas conscientes</span>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
              <strong>Hipoalergênico</strong>
              <span>para pele sensível</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" id="colecoes">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-box">
          <h2>Entre na nova temporada de brilho</h2>
          <p>
            Explore nossas coleções exclusivas com tons sofisticados, acabamento impecável e itens
            indispensáveis para a sua rotina de beleza.
          </p>
          <a href="#contato" class="btn btn-primary">Fale com a gente</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer id="contato">
    © 2026 Glow Atelier • maquiagem premium • contato@glowatelier.com
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
